🔹 1. Git Setup Commands
✅ Version check
git --version

✅ Username set karo
git config --global user.name "Your Name"

✅ Email set karo
git config --global user.email "you@example.com"

✅ Config check karo
git config --list

🔹 2. Repository Create / Clone
✅ Naya repo initialize karo
git init

✅ Remote repo clone karo
git clone https://github.com/username/repository.git


(GitHub ka official site: GitHub)

🔹 3. File Add & Commit
✅ File status check karo
git status

✅ File add karo (staging area me)
git add filename

✅ Sab files add karo
git add .

✅ Commit karo
git commit -m "Your commit message"

🔹 4. Branch Commands
✅ Branch list dekho
git branch

✅ Nayi branch banao
git branch branch-name

✅ Branch switch karo
git checkout branch-name

✅ New branch + switch ek saath
git checkout -b branch-name

✅ Modern command (recommended)
git switch branch-name

🔹 5. Remote Commands
✅ Remote add karo
git remote add origin https://github.com/username/repo.git

✅ Remote check karo
git remote -v

✅ Code push karo
git push origin branch-name

✅ Code pull karo
git pull origin branch-name

✅ Changes fetch karo
git fetch

🔹 6. Log & History
✅ Commit history dekho
git log

✅ Short log
git log --oneline

🔹 7. Undo / Reset Commands
✅ File unstage karo
git restore --staged filename

✅ Last commit undo (keep changes)
git reset --soft HEAD~1

✅ Hard reset (danger ⚠️)
git reset --hard HEAD~1

🔹 8. Merge
✅ Branch merge karo
git merge branch-name

📌 Basic Git Workflow
git init
git add .
git commit -m "message"
git branch new-branch
git checkout new-branch
git push origin new-branch

